language design-core version 0.5.
actor DocumentConsumer.
field EntryPath.
activity ExistingCapability.
activity IndependentPackaging.
field LeaseIdentity.
unit LeaseStore.
capability LeasedDocumentDelivery.
field ModelRevision.
feature OnDemandDocumentation.
functionality OpenCapturedReaderTarget.
interface ProjectRegistryPort.
unit ProjectionBroker.
message PublishedViewResult.
unit ReaderAdapter.
interface ReaderDeliveryPort.
usecase RequestDesignView.
functionality ResolveCurrentView.
functionality RetainPublishedView.
message SelectViewRequest.
field SelectionSequence.
field SelectionUri.
mode Serving.
functionality SubmitViewSelection.
channel ViewCalls.
contract ViewCallsProtocol.
interface ViewProjectionPort.
contract ViewPublication.
scenario ViewPublished.
unit ViewRequestClient.
container ViewRequestProcess.
contract ViewSelection.
container ViewServiceProcess.
DocumentConsumer pursues RequestDesignView.
EntryPath has presence = required.
EntryPath has value-type = text.
ExistingCapability addresses OpenCapturedReaderTarget.
ExistingCapability addresses ResolveCurrentView.
ExistingCapability addresses RetainPublishedView.
ExistingCapability addresses SubmitViewSelection.
ExistingCapability delivers OnDemandDocumentation.
ExistingCapability has implementation-status = implemented.
IndependentPackaging has implementation-status = planned.
LeaseIdentity has presence = required.
LeaseIdentity has value-type = text.
LeaseStore owns RetainPublishedView.
LeasedDocumentDelivery requires ProjectRegistryPort in mode Serving.
LeasedDocumentDelivery requires ReaderDeliveryPort in mode Serving.
LeasedDocumentDelivery requires ViewProjectionPort in mode Serving.
ModelRevision has presence = required.
ModelRevision has value-type = text.
OnDemandDocumentation supports RequestDesignView.
OpenCapturedReaderTarget allocated-to ViewServiceProcess in mode Serving.
OpenCapturedReaderTarget contributes-to OnDemandDocumentation.
OpenCapturedReaderTarget realizes LeasedDocumentDelivery.
ProjectionBroker consumes ProjectRegistryPort.
ProjectionBroker consumes ViewProjectionPort.
ProjectionBroker owns ResolveCurrentView.
ProjectionBroker uses ViewCalls as receiver of SelectViewRequest in mode Serving.
ProjectionBroker uses ViewCalls as sender of PublishedViewResult in mode Serving.
PublishedViewResult has message-kind = result.
PublishedViewResult replies-to SelectViewRequest.
PublishedViewResult upholds ViewPublication.
ReaderAdapter consumes ReaderDeliveryPort.
ReaderAdapter owns OpenCapturedReaderTarget.
ResolveCurrentView allocated-to ViewServiceProcess in mode Serving.
ResolveCurrentView contributes-to OnDemandDocumentation.
ResolveCurrentView realizes LeasedDocumentDelivery.
RetainPublishedView allocated-to ViewServiceProcess in mode Serving.
RetainPublishedView contributes-to OnDemandDocumentation.
RetainPublishedView realizes LeasedDocumentDelivery.
SelectViewRequest has message-kind = request.
SelectViewRequest upholds ViewSelection.
SelectionSequence has presence = required.
SelectionSequence has value-type = unsigned.
SelectionUri has presence = required.
SelectionUri has value-type = text.
SubmitViewSelection allocated-to ViewRequestProcess in mode Serving.
SubmitViewSelection contributes-to OnDemandDocumentation.
SubmitViewSelection realizes LeasedDocumentDelivery.
ViewCalls upholds ViewCallsProtocol.
ViewCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
ViewCallsProtocol permits PublishedViewResult.
ViewCallsProtocol permits SelectViewRequest.
ViewPublication has completeness = closed.
ViewPublication has-field EntryPath.
ViewPublication has-field LeaseIdentity.
ViewPublication has-field ModelRevision.
ViewPublished exercises RequestDesignView.
ViewPublished has completeness = closed.
ViewPublished illustrates ExistingCapability.
ViewPublished runs-in Serving.
ViewPublished step 1 sends SelectViewRequest from ViewRequestClient to ProjectionBroker via ViewCalls.
ViewPublished step 2 sends PublishedViewResult from ProjectionBroker to ViewRequestClient via ViewCalls reply-to 1.
ViewRequestClient owns SubmitViewSelection.
ViewRequestClient uses ViewCalls as receiver of PublishedViewResult in mode Serving.
ViewRequestClient uses ViewCalls as sender of SelectViewRequest in mode Serving.
ViewRequestProcess contains ViewRequestClient.
ViewSelection has completeness = closed.
ViewSelection has-field SelectionSequence.
ViewSelection has-field SelectionUri.
ViewServiceProcess contains LeaseStore.
ViewServiceProcess contains ProjectionBroker.
ViewServiceProcess contains ReaderAdapter.
ViewServiceProcess provides LeasedDocumentDelivery.
